      "id": "9e7f513f877285c5a9a99a7b025441b82174384e6081a524fb600b2fbd36461b",
      "text": "Evalite - an Early Preview",
      "hash": "9c186c6fd0004355580a24716c244c0e30e94ce91989e193e4cc0b5e19ae30a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "64645943132042b2c9149144651789a5a79c4251c532952f1ed1e84a02b9804a",
      "text": "An early preview of Evalite, a local-first, TypeScript-native tool for testing LLM-powered apps, based on Vitest.",
      "hash": "e43d158b4806594c2712b2249119403b63805d9197eaa4cb79c8f620deece276"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea65345cbd3b9e769989b762f8ceccaf4fa493edb59ad6524090db3ce68381e3",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed450b846b072b8dc2eb29dc503b40b22e79c0e9dd0e00c90c087c1152b47b4c",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "3591fe798506759f8946b085df33de51f2642e61b7e66c979b75f01c8861f6cb",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e45c908a48049e2601080ba0a37f4d022ddee184db59184bb811b3c5e62ade4c",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "59168ba0622576b3b1801e6b284b94cecb1704c7b275ec2294eec24a4cf458c3",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "7277d102057b4e8efb84f1384c9a4133dc3a642951614d2d393a10c2aa72ad27",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d9b3817c531c48d507c7b23521dc424a93be7a9a308c6fd40c12fa26884c748",
      "text": "It feels crazy to me that there's no TypeScript-native, local-first tool for testing LLM-powered apps.",
      "hash": "ba3d3d064b7d6a081be06da6cb7a4579da185b586d1d9c7e1c13fa210e303f62"
    },
    {
      "id": "4bfbbd0578b02aa8745a4c4685892f301b437575ef33f7b45266beb1e4dac4a5",
      "text": "I want a simple test runner that can:",
      "hash": "82f4894fdf00c02946d5b077f2eabbd0a8a8aa2da77896a3bdbcce9a3fdc8e31"
    },
    {
      "id": "9258f22d45ecfa544836ca287092bb94e6fd22b58c45d9c5d6d8e948f3197ba7",
      "text": "Run my evals on a watch script",
      "hash": "85b1b90ddd1f4b75fc187a3f90771f2175cce23ffc7c7c120299b80183d97f51"
    },
    {
      "id": "7135bc06a5308542f9f3e9d898edcfe8993cd3ad1be1c16a2c90b7590613dc9c",
      "text": "Show me a UI for viewing traces, scores, inputs and outputs",
      "hash": "f30138e62666da9f8a6549207ae26c574dc48799b1ec1e2346bc6aa46b96be95"
    },
    {
      "id": "c305c3ac540544577a45e7111855ac5e6084ef9f689fafec9381a033f5b775e5",
      "text": "Not need me to sign up for an API key",
      "hash": "a05cbbd24daccb4be56470319e14ae45cff9aeaaa42dd5e117c231def1adb27c"
    },
    {
      "id": "81067b061082103532d2aac4ee2691adcc96f92aa97f4425535eecd8839b4d50",
      "text": "So, I'm building one.",
      "hash": "f1a67d09e910be3051bc2150041f8c9dddc7408ff575a85be4db7649c331495d"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa3670899f57c0cf08300c6202813edbd97242b5971dfbb0e619eda89dc8e6ee",
      "text": "It's based on Vitest, and it's called Evalite.",
      "hash": "732764218d48286cc2a7cbbe34c8bde814dda5c3c077e94f8223199c943a7d5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b3e0ed5cdc8c1c942d9dd8f0fea7cfe73500e2920b08822ddaf63e6709280e4",
      "text": "Here's an early preview.",
      "hash": "e6ad5b5cf4c2762d5dcf432a8ccd982cf03b490689ad12e9d4f6a432d596d155"
    },
    {
      "id": "b54c217b92d2e6f5a709890b38c026fe9f5cfaf596d2f770f8e8a60ea99d2f6e",
      "text": "Don't know what evals are? Learn about them",
      "hash": "1fc6751e40410af631c6993894a62f7bc29257a07665e6a1f244ffe6e73525a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe8d664fe97d66ec8fb77f35f24fb9cd328ffa9fedbb235fca69d5d4845fb584",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
